The Kurokoma-Kanemoto War ({{nihongo|Kurokoma Kanemoto Sensou|黒駒金本の戦争}}), was a political and military dispute that took place in [[Nagashima (Nakamizu)|Nagashima]] island, [[Nakamizu]] during the beginning of [[Miyagami Period]] mainly between [[Kurokoma clan]] and [[Kanemoto Clan|Kanemoto clan]] over the control of what was southern court of [[Miyagi Empire]]. Imperial backed Kanemoto eventually victorious over the challenging Kurokoma clan, while also starts the long decline of Umijin clans over Nakamizu.
